/Code/external/comdare-cache-engine/docs/architecture/05b_uml_klassenatlas_20260805.html:2328:<article class=\"k\" data-n=\"binarykeypolicy genus derive_key derive_lager_key completed_system_line\"><header><span class=\"kind\">struct</span> <code class=\"nm\">BinaryKeyPolicy</code></header><p class=\"z\">Binary-Genus-Key-Policy: SHA512-Anatomie-Digest ueber Stempel-Zeilen plus Zell-Klammer.</p><ul class=\"ms\"><li><code>+ static constexpr Genus genus() noexcept</code></li><li><code>+ static Sha512Key derive_key(std::span&lt;std::string_view const&gt; stamp_lines, abi::SystemCellValues zellwerte = {})</code></li><li><code>+ static LagerKey derive_lager_key(std::span&lt;std::string_view const&gt; stamp_lines, ZellKoordinaten const&amp; zelle, abi::SystemCellValues zellwerte = {})</code></li><li><code>- static std::string completed_system_line(std::span&lt;std::string_view const&gt; stamp_lines, abi::SystemCellValues zellwerte)</code></li></ul><p class=\"f\">bestandslog_factory.hpp:60</p></article>\n/home/comdare/Projekte/Research/probst-diplomarbeit-cache-engine/Code/external/comdare-cache-engine/docs/architecture/05b_uml_klassenatlas_20260805.html:2329:<article class=\"k\" data-n=\"messwertkeypolicy genus derive_key derive_lager_key\"><header><span class=\"kind\">struct</span> <code class=\"nm\">MesswertKeyPolicy</code></header><p class=\"z\">Messwert-Genus-Key-Policy: Digest ueber Mess-Zeilen plus Hardware-Identitaet.</p><ul class=\"ms\"><li><code>+ static constexpr Genus genus() noexcept</code></li><li><code>+ static Sha512Key derive_key(std::span&lt;std::string_view const&gt; components)</code></li><li><code>+ static LagerKey derive_lager_key(std::span&lt;std::string_view const&gt; components, ZellKoordinaten const&amp; zelle)</code></li></ul><p class=\"f\">bestandslog_factory.hpp:97</p></article>\n/home/comdare/Projekte/Research/probst-diplomarbeit-cache-engine/Code/external/comdare-cache-engine/docs/architecture/05b_uml_klassenatlas_20260805.html:2330:<article c